# Source development: manually copy to this application's root .env, preserving any existing file.
# 源码开发：手工复制至本应用根.env；已有内容由Owner核对，不覆盖。
# Optional profile root: nonblank process > this .env > Tauri application local-data directory.
# 可选profile根：非空进程 > 本文件 > Tauri原默认；空值不是“新空目录”。
# Absolute literal only: no ~, $VAR, ${VAR}, parent traversal or shell evaluation. First duplicate wins.
# 仅绝对字面路径，不展开变量；重复键首项生效。dev/build不自动隔离数据。
DS_PROFILE_DIR=

# pnpm tauri dev includes native-s7. UI + SQLite own instances/points/policies and saved/loaded versions.
# 启动始终stopped；保存、停机加载、工作台显式启动分开，运行意图/连接不恢复。
# Installed-package .env discovery/distribution is outside this source-development contract.
